        range 500 2500
        default 1368

    config NIULAI_FORMAL_RR_KNEE_REST_US
        int "RR knee rest pulse (us)"
        range 500 2500
        default 1279

    comment "Formal per-channel mechanical pulse envelope"

    config NIULAI_FORMAL_CH0_MIN_US
        int "CH0 minimum pulse (us)"
        range 500 2500
        default 1400
        help
            This cannot widen the current hard safety envelope. Recalibration
            requires changing the reviewed source defaults and repeating the
            hardware safety review.

