            This is an experimental safety/feel parameter, not a servo spec.

    config NIULAI_SERVO_MAX_ACCELERATION_US_S2
        int "Per-servo interpolation acceleration limit (us/s^2)"
        range 100 100000
        default 3600
        help
            Acceleration/deceleration bound for online target interpolation.

    comment "Pose mapping (EXP-001 bench-tuning candidates, not final specs)"

